     i=  5:  i^2-|i| = 20  (>=0: True)
  Part B:  (m^2 + n^2) - m  =  m**2 - m + n**2  =  (m-1)*m + n^2
  since m,n >= 1 integers:  (m-1)*m >= 0 and n^2 >= 1  ->  (m^2+n^2)-m >= 1  -> strict
